@joe-broadhead/opencode-gws-bin-<target>

bin/gws is the unmodified Google Workspace CLI (gws) 0.22.5 release binary
for <triple>, from https://github.com/googleworkspace/cli/releases/tag/v0.22.5.
It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; LICENSE is the license
file shipped in the same release archive. The gws CLI is not an officially
supported Google product.

provenance.json records the release archive URL and the SHA-256 digests of
the archive and the binary.

This package exists only to supply gws to @joe-broadhead/opencode-gws, an
unofficial OpenCode plugin. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.
